comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T09:25:31.280Z",codex-sol,"The caller example intentionally uses release commit and exact version placeholders. The currently published extension predates the gate, and this work is authorized only in the pm-github worktree. No pilot workflow in another repository was changed, enabled, or dispatched. Resolve the placeholders only after a reviewed release and separately authorized caller adoption."
  "2026-10-17T10:58:16.179Z",codex-agent,"Remaining rollout follow-up for pm-github-8r7c: GitHub excludes workflow_dispatch job checks from PR branch rules. After the reviewed provider release, authorize one-time caller App client-ID/private-key mapping for eligible native PR runs, add CodeQL workflow_dispatch for additional head verification, remove or expand explicit closeout ci.yml overrides, and declare required-checks per current protection policy. docs/bot-pr-automation.md lists all 24 callers and contexts. Preserve existing disabled pilot states until separately authorized; this task inspected callers read-only and did not change, enable or dispatch them."
